    IDS_READY_UPGRADE_KEEP "Your files, apps, user accounts and settings are kept. The LiberNT system files, the registry entries of the system and the bootloader are replaced. No partition is created, deleted or formatted."
    IDS_UPGRADE_PROCESSTITLE "Upgrading LiberNT"
    IDS_UPGRADE_PROCESSSUBTITLE "Setup replaces the system files, updates the registry and installs the bootloader. Your files, apps and settings are kept. This can take a few minutes."
